Implemented and committed the first code batch:

`f3f8f4c3 feat(model): add durable release identity and digests`

It adds:

- opaque ecosystem-qualified `ReleasePackageId`;
- strict `ArtifactDigest`, `SemanticInputDigest`, and `IntentDigest` types;
- SHA-256 artifact hashing;
- versioned, domain-separated, length-prefixed canonical transcript primitives;
- fixed-vector, serialization, malformed-input, ordering, and domain-separation tests.

The independently gated foundation spec is committed as:

`fb42f03 docs(spec): define durable release execution foundation`

`just fmt`, `just fmt-check`, and `just lint` pass. New model tests pass. Full `just test` still reaches an unrelated pre-existing CLI snapshot failure caused by `git rev-parse HEAD` in an unborn temporary repository.

Next batch is graph-owned intent/DAG construction and validation capability.

